# WLISTTR.KEY - the count adjusted by the owner (A adds one, SHIFT-A
# takes one, each then reloading) over the eleven rows of WLLONG.REQ;
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WLISTTR.SNP.
S START
K A
S ADD1
K A
S ADD2
K SHIFT-A
S SUB1
K SHIFT-A
S SUB2
K SHIFT-A
S SUB3
# A jump after the change steps by pages.
K 6
S JUMP6
# Never fewer than the rows up to the last held.
K SHIFT-A SHIFT-A SHIFT-A SHIFT-A
S FLOOR
K 0
S JUMP0
# Once the rows held end the list, the rows held count it.
K B
S END
K A
S ENDADD
K T
S TOP
